  "findings": [
    "GetAllyFactionBySide reads saved ally bytes; SetAllyFactionBySide writes only side1/2; ClearGameStateVariables zeroes both.",
    "GetAllyNationForSide compares saved ally and main; equality returns byte0, inequality returns saved ally. Invalid side uses fresh outputs0.",
    "OnlineMatch converts startingMatchData.ally_faction_right at i23634 and left at i24417 using UtilityFunctions.FactionStringToEnum(skipErrorCheck=false), then writes sides2/1 at i23699/24482.",
    "These are separate FString starting-data fields, not the HQ faction, the deck card factions, or faction inferred from current ownership.",
    "Managed dispatch previously returned the empty string for every input; all ally metadata and saved-state pathways were absent."
  ],
  "changes": [
    "Independent LeftAllyFaction/RightAllyFaction bytes, explicit setter and narrow clear helper; fresh-output getter and equality-filtered numeric CardFunctions result.",
    "Explicit int/Side dispatch input; controller, receiver and self do not select the faction.",
    "ReplayData and ServerMatchSnapshot optional raw ally strings; starting-data JSON parser, replay importer, server bridge, HTTP adapter and validation-tool adapters preserve them.",
    "Common opening-label converter shared with main metadata; prior MainFactionFromStartingData API retained; unknown/missing/empty use0 with previously documented limits.",
    "Self-play explicitly configures no ally faction0/0, separately from London main2/2; no automatic deck inference.",
    "Ally bytes included in MatchSnapshot JSON and ActionJournal fingerprint."
  ],
